{
  "name": "realism-kitchen-appliances",
  "description": "Wave 2A realism audit: kitchen (5) + appliances (9) defs, each placed alone at the L/D centre and captured from a low 3/4 side angle (floor-contact + silhouette). Tall camera for wall/ceiling-mounted items. Variant frames for distinct enum modes (finishes, sink/hob, integrated, mount).",
